  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\int_{-\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\frac{96 x^2 \\cos ^2 x}{\\left(1+e^x\\right)} \\mathrm{d} x=\\pi\\left(\\alpha \\pi^2+\\beta\\right), \\alpha, \\beta \\in \\mathbb{Z}$, then $(\\alpha+\\beta)^2$ equals",
